# Ending phase fixture only: final tier and damage are injected.
# Pipe entry and temporary damage immunity are fixtures; no earned clear.
# Map/node fixture enters room 146, then a labelled pipe-action transfer enters 0FF.
# Entry fixture below; the explicitly marked ending fixture later writes tier/damage.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
# Survey: override the map 6 lower-left node level and enter it.
