poke 1f17 2801e8012801e801
poke 1f1f 12001e0012001e00
poke 0100 0b
wait 240
poke d7e2 6a
press y 2
wait 240
dump approach146
# Seven Koopalings entry boundary only; labelled pipe-action room transfer.
# No invulnerability, completion writes, imported saves or forced movement.
