poke 19b8 ff
poke 19d8 04
poke 88 0000
poke 71 06
wait 180
dump fight180
wait 420
dump fight600
wait 600
dump fight1200
wait 1200
dump fight2400

# ASSISTED COMBAT: keep Mario damage-immune to exercise offensive phase logic.
